{"availability":"available","full":"cdburgess75/PacketMap","name":"PacketMap","description":"Live APRS map with GPS beaconing and two-way messaging — a single-file PWA that installs from the browser, works offline, and needs no account.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-17T00:08:31Z","updated":"2026-09-26T19:06:55Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://cdburgess75.github.io/PacketMap/","topics":["amateur-radio","aprs","aprs-is","geolocation","ham-radio","leaflet","maps","offline-first","openstreetmap","pwa","service-worker","single-file","vanilla-javascript"],"demo":"https://cdburgess75.github.io/PacketMap/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:55.691Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:55.691Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:55.691Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T05:44:55.691Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The live map of amateur radio's data network — in your pocket, centred on you.","One HTML file. No app store, no account, no server to host.","Watch thousands of stations beacon their position and weather in real time — then join in from your phone's GPS."],"features":["Heard list · Station detail with 24 h weather history · Two-way messaging","🗺️ Live map — Real-time APRS-IS feed on OpenStreetMap with authentic APRS symbols. The server-side filter follows your GPS. Adjustable radius (10–500 km), callsign search, one-tap fit-to-stations.","🚗 Driving mode — One green GO button: full screen, follow-me tracking, and a screen-wake lock together. The map stays on you and the phone stays awake.","📡 Beaconing — SmartBeaconing scales your rate with speed and pegs corners on turns (20 min parked, up to once a minute at highway speed). One-tap SEND NOW, a master Transmit switch, and configurable symbol / SSID /…","💬 Messaging — Conversation threads per callsign, automatic {id} sequencing, retries until acke